{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fAUQCyJ7ql1793800569.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國籃球名宿姚明、乒乓鄧亞萍等在港出席欖球活動。</p><p></p><p>三位中國體壇明星兼勞倫斯世界體育學院成員，奧運冠軍、體操李小鵬，乒乓的鄧亞萍，及八次入選NBA全明星陣容、身高2米29的火箭前中鋒姚明，放下自己的專項，與七欖港隊的莊嘉欣，在港會球場指導大約25位小學生進行欖球體驗，屬於勞倫斯體育公益基金會「青年身心同行計劃」活動。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.RUGBY.YAO-2100_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KSUMPPeEaN1793800808.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.RUGBY.YAO-2100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AUPQX1jWxK1793800826.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>透過非撞式欖球，讓學生在無壓力環境下，培養情緒調節能力，建立正面同儕關係，同時提升個人抗逆力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:40.593368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:05.771868+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:26.832213+00:00","content_hash":"fa20f1747356c59acbf69aa4f188fc1f8e068a1f0ceba09667ab102805d2284b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:40.593368+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}